    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/7731da6cbbf014c30c0e5a7893c1934c.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=120 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is Chess Twist?</h2><br>It is a chess variant on an irregular grid.<br><br>The moves are the same, but the board is very much not the same. Forget straight lines, it's distortion all the way down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/d0e8d575c62c202059e6fb26d009819a.poster.avif?t=1717728227\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/d0e8d575c62c202059e6fb26d009819a.webm?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/d0e8d575c62c202059e6fb26d009819a.mp4?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hundreds of procedurally generated boards<br></li><li> Play against a bot<br></li><li> Play with a timer<br></li><li> Multiplayer on the same device<br></li><li> Multiplayer online in public lobbies<br></li><li> Multiplayer online with private links you can share with friends<br></li><li> Preview your moves</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of Boards</h2><br>Generate new boards on the fly until you find one you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/158afdd0bb2e2bc255150ee88c670747.poster.avif?t=1717728227\" width=472 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/158afdd0bb2e2bc255150ee88c670747.webm?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/158afdd0bb2e2bc255150ee88c670747.mp4?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And you can always preview your moves, to help strategize:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/402f624953dc4f9cf624c21c8a01c2eb.poster.avif?t=1717728227\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/402f624953dc4f9cf624c21c8a01c2eb.webm?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/402f624953dc4f9cf624c21c8a01c2eb.mp4?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look at how twisted some moves can be</h2><br>The white rook can potential put the opponent in check by just moving a pawn and knight:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/aeaa0e9d63f33c8e0cdcd4430110f166.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=616 /></span><br><br>And only a pawn protects the king from the black bishop:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/a692271576ed0717e9ff4cfe32fd68cf.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=616 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><br>You can play together on the same device, or online in public or private.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/5826382fff483e8a043aadc1d3467e70.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=402 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a stronger Chess player</h2><br>An unconventional game is perfect to help you develop unconventional strategies.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Improve your skill of detecting new moves.<br></li><li> Get out of the habit of relying on past/learned games.<br></li><li> Notice new types of attacks before they capture your pieces.</li></ul><br>Remember how Rocky ran on top of a mountain to train for his match against Drago? In the same way, play Chess Twist to defeat Magnus!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/7731da6cbbf014c30c0e5a7893c1934c.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=120 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is Chess Twist?</h2><br>It is a chess variant on an irregular grid.<br><br>The moves are the same, but the board is very much not the same. Forget straight lines, it's distortion all the way down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/d0e8d575c62c202059e6fb26d009819a.poster.avif?t=1717728227\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/d0e8d575c62c202059e6fb26d009819a.webm?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/d0e8d575c62c202059e6fb26d009819a.mp4?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hundreds of procedurally generated boards<br></li><li> Play against a bot<br></li><li> Play with a timer<br></li><li> Multiplayer on the same device<br></li><li> Multiplayer online in public lobbies<br></li><li> Multiplayer online with private links you can share with friends<br></li><li> Preview your moves</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of Boards</h2><br>Generate new boards on the fly until you find one you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/158afdd0bb2e2bc255150ee88c670747.poster.avif?t=1717728227\" width=472 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/158afdd0bb2e2bc255150ee88c670747.webm?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/158afdd0bb2e2bc255150ee88c670747.mp4?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And you can always preview your moves, to help strategize:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/402f624953dc4f9cf624c21c8a01c2eb.poster.avif?t=1717728227\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/402f624953dc4f9cf624c21c8a01c2eb.webm?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/402f624953dc4f9cf624c21c8a01c2eb.mp4?t=1717728227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look at how twisted some moves can be</h2><br>The white rook can potential put the opponent in check by just moving a pawn and knight:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/aeaa0e9d63f33c8e0cdcd4430110f166.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=616 /></span><br><br>And only a pawn protects the king from the black bishop:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/a692271576ed0717e9ff4cfe32fd68cf.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=616 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><br>You can play together on the same device, or online in public or private.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775560/extras/5826382fff483e8a043aadc1d3467e70.avif?t=1717728227\" width=616 height=402 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a stronger Chess player</h2><br>An unconventional game is perfect to help you develop unconventional strategies.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Improve your skill of detecting new moves.<br></li><li> Get out of the habit of relying on past/learned games.<br></li><li> Notice new types of attacks before they capture your pieces.</li></ul><br>Remember how Rocky ran on top of a mountain to train for his match against Drago? In the same way, play Chess Twist to defeat Magnus!",
